      "writtenOn": "2023-08-21T18:48:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "All the Kotlin experts I\u0027ve talked to seem to consider `!!` to be a code smell and suggest using `checkNotNull` instead.  I think that is because `checkNotNull` allows you to specify a more useful error message if desired, although its use seems to be preferred even without an error message.",
