      "writtenOn": "2023-08-22T03:09:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, [`setTransportInfo`](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Connectivity/framework/src/android/net/NetworkCapabilities.java;l\u003d1685;drc\u003d7a042d869f009e24c7dbaa7741362f72c0dd0ad0) is `@NonNull`, but [`getTransportInfo`] is `@Nullable`.  That means kotlin can\u0027t match up the getter and the setter, so it makes the implicit property a read-only `val`, and gives an unhelpful error about \"val can\u0027t be redefined\" when you try to assign to it.",
      "parentUuid": "f76af6f6_1c8986f6",
